@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Service root
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Model information
GET {{baseUrl}}/model-info

### Single prediction
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sepal_length_cm": 5.1,
  "sepal_width_cm": 3.5,
  "petal_length_cm": 1.4,
  "petal_width_cm": 0.2
}

### Invalid prediction — observe HTTP 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sepal_length_cm": -1,
  "sepal_width_cm": 3.5,
  "petal_length_cm": 1.4,
  "petal_width_cm": 0.2
}
